.Dd November 15, 2026
.Dt DTRACE_PROBE_LIST 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm dtrace_probe_list
.Nd list the registered DTrace probes
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Fn dtrace_probe_list out max
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm writes up to
.Fa max
probe records to
.Fa out
and returns the total number of registered probes.
A record is 52 bytes: a 32-bit identifier, a 16-byte NUL-padded provider name
and a 32-byte NUL-padded probe name.
A
.Fa max
of zero returns the count without touching
.Fa out .
.Pp
The current provider set is static; the initial probe is
.Li syscall::entry .
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width Er
.It Er EFAULT
.Fa out
is not writable user memory.
.El
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
